  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many cups of clay does each student need for one dish? Jada makes three times as many clay dishes as Rory. Rory makes 22 more clay dishes than Kora. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 5; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nHow many cups of clay does each student need for one dish? Jada makes three times as many clay dishes as Rory. Rory makes 22 more clay dishes than Kora. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Jada makes twice as many clay dishes as Rory.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. Rory makes 20 more clay dishes than Kora.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: Kora makes 20 clay dishes.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many total clay dishes do Jada and Rory make together?\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Jada, Rory, and Kora make clay dishes for their school art project.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 clay dishes.\n\nRory makes 20 more than Kora:\n\n\\[\n20+20=40\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\n2\\times 40=80\n\\]\n\nTherefore, Jada and Rory make together:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many clay dishes do Jada, Rory, and Kora make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes, Rory makes 40, and Jada makes 80.\n\n\\[\n80+40+20=\\boxed{140\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
